  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      323.61,
      455.86,
      360.5
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 442 of the Code of Criminal ProcedureAct, No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legaleffect of the amendment is to make provision to issue one certified copy of the judgmentor final order of the record to each of the parties to the case free of charge.",
