      262.45
    ],
    "text": "3. Section 443 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in paragraph (b), by the substitution for the wordsand figures \u201con payments made at the rates mentioned insection 442\u201d of the words and figures \u201csubject to theprovisions of section 442\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
